<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-AU">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"/>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/>
<title>Central Coast Exterior Cleaning</title>
<meta name="description" content="Premium exterior cleaning on the Central Coast. Pressure washing, soft washing, roof cleaning, and driveway restoration."/>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel="preload" as="style" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo:wght@400;600;700&family=Public+Sans:wght@400;500;600&family=Chivo+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo:wght@400;600;700&family=Public+Sans:wght@400;500;600&family=Chivo+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" media="print" onload="this.media='all'">
<noscript><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo:wght@400;600;700&family=Public+Sans:wght@400;500;600&family=Chivo+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap"></noscript>
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="assets/favicon.png"/>
<meta property="og:title" content="Central Coast Exterior Cleaning"/>
<meta property="og:description" content="Premium exterior cleaning on the Central Coast. Pressure washing, soft washing, roof cleaning, and driveway restoration."/>
<meta property="og:image" content="assets/logo.png"/>
<meta property="og:type" content="website"/>
<style>
:root{
  --ink:#0f1316;
  --ground:#f4f6f7;
  --hairline:#dfe4e6;
  --accent:#303a44;
  --aqua:#2b7f8a;
  --bg:#ffffff;
  --line:#dfe4e6;
  --radius:8px;
  --maxw:1120px;
  --space:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,3rem);
  --space-sm:clamp(0.75rem,1.5vw,1.5rem);
  --lbq-muted:#6b7a8a;
}
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
  html{scroll-behavior:auto}
  .rv{opacity:1!important;transform:none!important;transition:none!important}
}
<noscript><style>.rv{opacity:1!important;transform:none!important;transition:none!important}</style></noscript>
body{margin:0;font-family:"Public Sans",system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--ink);background:var(--bg);line-height:1.6;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
img{max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
a:hover{text-decoration:underline}
h1,h2,h3{font-family:"Archivo",system-ui,sans-serif;line-height:1.15;margin:0;font-weight:700}
h1{font-size:clamp(2.25rem,5vw,4rem);letter-spacing:-0.02em}
h2{font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2.25rem);letter-spacing:-0.01em}
h3{font-size:clamp(1.125rem,2vw,1.375rem)}
p{margin:0 0 1rem}
.container{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:0 auto;padding:0 var(--space-sm)}
.rv{opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px);transition:opacity .7s ease,transform .7s ease}
.rv.on{opacity:1;transform:none}
.js .rv:not(.on){opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)}
.js .rv.on{opacity:1;transform:none}
header{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:100;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.92);backdrop-filter:saturate(180%) blur(8px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--hairline)}
.header-inner{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;height:64px;gap:var(--space-sm)}
.logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.625rem;flex-shrink:0}
.logo svg{width:36px;height:36px}
.logo span{font-family:"Archivo",system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:1.125rem;color:var(--ink);letter-spacing:-0.01em}
nav{display:flex;gap:0.25rem}
nav a{padding:0.5rem 0.875rem;border-radius:var(--radius);font-size:0.875rem;font-weight:500;color:var(--accent);transition:background .15s,color .15s}
nav a:hover{background:var(--ground);color:var(--ink);text-decoration:none}
.cta-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:0.5rem;padding:0.75rem 1.5rem;background:var(--aqua);color:#fff;font-family:"Archivo",system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:0.9375rem;border-radius:var(--radius);border:0;cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s,transform .1s}
.cta-btn:hover{background:#236b75;transform:translateY(-1px);text-decoration:none}
.cta-btn:active{transform:translateY(0)}
.hero{padding:clamp(3rem,6vw,6rem) 0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--ground) 0%,var(--bg) 100%)}
.hero-inner{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem);align-items:center}
.hero-copy{text-align:center}
.hero-copy h1{margin-bottom:0.75rem}
.hero-tagline{font-size:clamp(1.125rem,2.5vw,1.5rem);color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;max-width:48ch;margin:0 auto 1.5rem}
.hero-canvas{width:100%;max-width:560px;aspect-ratio:1;margin:0 auto}
.hero-canvas canvas{width:100%;height:100%;border-radius:var(--radius);background:var(--ground);border:1px solid var(--hairline)}
section{padding:var(--space) 0}
.section-head{text-align:center;margin-bottom:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2.5rem)}
.section-head h2{margin-bottom:0.5rem}
.section-lead{color:var(--accent);max-width:48ch;margin:0 auto;font-size:1.0625rem}
.service-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));gap:clamp(1rem,2vw,1.5rem)}
.service-card{background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--hairline);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:clamp(1.25rem,2vw,1.75rem);transition:border .15s,box-shadow .15s}
.service-card:hover{border-color:var(--aqua);box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(43,127,138,0.12)}
.service-icon{width:48px;height:48px;margin-bottom:1rem;color:var(--aqua)}
.service-card h3{margin-bottom:0.5rem}
.service-card p{color:var(--accent);font-size:0.9375rem;margin:0}
.process-band{background:var(--ground);border-top:1px solid var(--hairline);border-bottom:1px solid var(--hairline)}
.process-steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:clamp(1rem,2vw,1.5rem)}
.step{text-align:center;padding:var(--space-sm)}
.step-num{font-family:"Chivo Mono",monospace;font-size:clamp(2.5rem,5vw,4rem);font-weight:500;color:var(--aqua);opacity:0.3;line-height:1;margin-bottom:0.5rem}
.step h3{margin-bottom:0.375rem}
.step p{color:var(--accent);font-size:0.9375rem;margin:0}
.locality-band{background:var(--ink);color:#fff}
.locality-band .container{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2rem);align-items:center;text-align:center}
.locality-band h2{color:#fff}
.locality-band p{color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);margin:0}
.locality-links{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:0.75rem;justify-content:center}
.locality-links a{padding:0.625rem 1.25rem;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);border-radius:var(--radius);font-size:0.875rem;font-weight:500;transition:border .15s,background .15s}
.locality-links a:hover{border-color:var(--aqua);background:rgba(43,127,138,0.2);color:#fff;text-decoration:none}
footer{background:var(--ink);color:#fff;padding:clamp(2.5rem,4vw,4rem) 0 var(--space-sm)}
.footer-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2.5rem);margin-bottom:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2rem)}
.footer-brand{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;text-align:center;gap:0.75rem}
.footer-brand .logo svg{width:48px;height:48px}
.footer-brand .logo span{color:#fff;font-size:1.25rem}
.footer-brand p{color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);font-size:0.9375rem;margin:0;max-width:32ch}
.footer-links{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(160px,1fr));gap:1.5rem;text-align:center}
.footer-col h4{font-family:"Archivo",system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:0.875rem;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.08em;color:var(--aqua);margin:0 0 0.875rem}
.footer-col a{display:block;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);font-size:0.9375rem;padding:0.25rem 0;transition:color .15s}
.footer-col a:hover{color:var(--aqua);text-decoration:none}
.footer-bottom{border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);padding-top:1.5rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem;text-align:center;font-size:0.8125rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5)}
.footer-bottom a{color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);text-decoration:underline}
.footer-bottom a:hover{color:var(--aqua)}
.legal{padding:var(--space) 0;border-top:1px solid var(--hairline)}
.legal h2{font-size:clamp(1.25rem,2.5vw,1.5rem);margin-bottom:1rem;text-align:center}
.legal article{max-width:65ch;margin:0 auto 2rem}
.legal h3{font-family:"Archivo",system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:1rem;margin:1.5rem 0 0.5rem;color:var(--accent)}
.legal p{color:var(--accent);font-size:0.9375rem}
.legal ul{margin:0.5rem 0 1rem 1.25rem;color:var(--accent);font-size:0.9375rem}
.legal li{margin:0.25rem 0}
@media (min-width:768px){
  .hero-inner{grid-template-columns:1.1fr 0.9fr;text-align:left}
  .hero-copy{text-align:left}
  .hero-tagline{margin-left:0;margin-right:auto}
  .locality-band .container{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;text-align:left}
  .footer-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
  .footer-brand{align-items:flex-start;text-align:left}
  .footer-links{text-align:left}
  .footer-bottom{flex-direction:row;justify-content:space-between}
}
@media (min-width:1024px){
  nav{display:flex!important}
  .mobile-menu-btn{display:none}
}
.mobile-menu-btn{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:40px;height:40px;border:1px solid var(--hairline);border-radius:var(--radius);background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);cursor:pointer}
.mobile-menu-btn svg{width:24px;height:24px}
#mobile-menu{display:none;position:absolute;top:100%;left:0;right:0;background:var(--bg);border-bottom:1px solid var(--hairline);padding:var(--space-sm);flex-direction:column;gap:0.25rem;box-shadow:0 8px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.08)}
#mobile-menu.open{display:flex}
#mobile-menu a{padding:0.75rem 1rem;border-radius:var(--radius);font-weight:500;color:var(--accent)}
#mobile-menu a:hover{background:var(--ground);color:var(--ink);text-decoration:none}
</style>
<style id="lb-motion-css">
/* ==== LB MOTION PACK ==== */
.lb-rb,.lb-rb *,.lb-mq,.lb-mq *{box-sizing:border-box}
/* A header must never be hidden by a scroll-reveal state: the nav/brand is chrome, not
   content. Unrevealed .rv wrappers left whole headers at opacity:0 (invisible logo). */
header, .site-header, .page-header, nav.nav, .nav .rv, nav.rv, .header-inner, .nav-inner,
header .rv, .site-header .rv, .nav-inner .rv{
  opacity:1 !important; visibility:visible !important; transform:none !important;
}
.lb-rb{position:relative;width:100%;max-width:100%;overflow:hidden;background:#0c0d10}
.lb-mq{max-width:100%;overflow:hidden}
.lb-rb__track{position:relative;width:100%;aspect-ratio:16/7}
.lb-rb__slide{position:absolute;inset:0;opacity:0;transition:opacity .9s ease;will-change:opacity}
.lb-rb__slide.is-on{opacity:1}
.lb-rb__slide img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;transform:scale(1.03);transition:transform 7s linear}
.lb-rb__slide.is-on img{transform:scale(1.10)}
.lb-rb__cap{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;padding:clamp(14px,2.2vw,30px);
 background:linear-gradient(180deg,transparent,rgba(6,7,10,.72));color:#fff;
 font-family:var(--lb-sub,Inter),sans-serif;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;
 font-size:clamp(9px,1vw,13px);z-index:2}
.lb-rb__dots{position:absolute;top:50%;right:clamp(10px,1.6vw,22px);transform:translateY(-50%);
 display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px;z-index:3}
.lb-rb__dots button{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.7);
 background:transparent;cursor:pointer;padding:0;transition:transform .25s,background .25s}
.lb-rb__dots button.is-on{background:#fff;transform:scale(1.35)}
.lb-rb__nav{position:absolute;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);z-index:3;width:44px;height:44px;
 border-radius:50%;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.35);background:rgba(8,9,12,.35);color:#fff;
 cursor:pointer;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:17px;line-height:1;backdrop-filter:blur(6px);
 transition:background .25s,transform .25s}
.lb-rb__nav:hover{background:rgba(8,9,12,.7)}
.lb-rb__nav--prev{left:clamp(10px,1.6vw,22px)}
.lb-rb__nav--next{right:clamp(10px,1.6vw,22px)}
.lb-rb__nav:active{transform:translateY(-50%) scale(.92)}
@media (max-width:700px){.lb-rb__track{aspect-ratio:4/3}.lb-rb__nav{width:36px;height:36px}}

a.btn,.btn,button.btn,.nav-cta a,.wp-block-button__link{position:relative;overflow:hidden;
 transition:transform .22s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.3,1),box-shadow .22s,filter .22s}
a.btn:hover,.btn:hover,button.btn:hover,.nav-cta a:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);
 box-shadow:0 10px 24px -12px rgba(0,0,0,.55);filter:brightness(1.05)}
a.btn:active,.btn:active,button.btn:active,.nav-cta a:active{transform:translateY(0) scale(.985)}
a.btn::after,.btn::after,.nav-cta a::after{content:'';position:absolute;top:0;bottom:0;width:38%;
 left:-60%;background:linear-gradient(100deg,transparent,rgba(255,255,255,.32),transparent);
 transform:skewX(-18deg);transition:left .55s ease;pointer-events:none}
a.btn:hover::after,.btn:hover::after,.nav-cta a:hover::after{left:130%}

.lb-rv{opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px);transition:opacity .7s ease,transform .7s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.3,1)}
.lb-rv.is-in{opacity:1;transform:none}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
 .lb-rv{opacity:1!important;transform:none!important;transition:none!important}
 .lb-rb__slide img{transform:none!important;transition:none!important}
 a.btn::after,.btn::after,.nav-cta a::after{display:none}
}

/* marquee band (professional, reference-derived) */
.lb-mq{position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:#0b0c10;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.10);
 border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.10)}
.lb-mq__in{display:flex;width:max-content;animation:lb-mq 34s linear infinite}
.lb-mq:hover .lb-mq__in{animation-play-state:paused}
.lb-mq__in span{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:clamp(18px,3vw,44px);
 padding:clamp(11px,1.5vw,19px) clamp(14px,2vw,26px);color:#fff;font-family:var(--lb-disp,Inter),sans-serif;
 font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.14em;font-size:clamp(11px,1.25vw,17px);white-space:nowrap}
.lb-mq__in span i{font-style:normal;color:var(--lb-acc,#e51924)}
@keyframes lb-mq{from{transform:translateX(0)}to{transform:translateX(-50%)}}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){.lb-mq__in{animation:none}}
</style>
<style id="lb-hero-css">
canvas.lb-hero-canvas{position:absolute; inset:0; width:100%; height:100%; display:block; z-index:0; pointer-events:none}
canvas#heroCanvas, canvas.hero-canvas, canvas.lb3d-canvas{
  position:absolute; inset:0; width:100%; height:100%; display:block; z-index:0;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
<div class="container header-inner">
<a class="logo" href="#" aria-label="Central Coast Exterior Cleaning - Home">
<img src="assets/logo.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" width="36" height="36" decoding="async" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high"/>
<span>Central Coast Exterior Cleaning</span>
</a>
<nav aria-label="Main navigation">
<a href="#services">Services</a>
<a href="#process">Our Approach</a>
<a href="#locality">Central Coast NSW</a>
</nav>
<a class="cta-btn" href="#lbq">Get a Quote</a>
<button class="mobile-menu-btn" aria-label="Open menu" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="mobile-menu" onclick="toggleMobileMenu()">
<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="3" y1="6" x2="21" y2="6"/><line x1="3" y1="12" x2="21" y2="12"/><line x1="3" y1="18" x2="21" y2="18"/></svg>
</button>
</div>
<div id="mobile-menu" role="navigation" aria-label="Mobile menu">
<a href="#services">Services</a>
<a href="#process">Our Approach</a>
<a href="#locality">Central Coast NSW</a>
<a class="cta-btn" href="#lbq" style="margin-top:0.5rem;text-align:center">Get a Quote</a>
</div>
</header>
<main><section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
<div class="container hero-inner">
<div class="hero-copy rv">
<h1 id="hero-title">Premium Exterior Cleaning on the Central Coast</h1>
<p class="hero-tagline">Pressure washing, soft washing, roof cleaning, and driveway restoration - done right the first time.</p>
<a class="cta-btn" href="#lbq">Get a Quote</a>
</div>
<div class="hero-canvas rv">
<canvas id="detail-canvas" aria-label="Pressure path detail: a wall panel with a clean band cutting through grime, water sheeting down, soft-wash nozzle fan, and clean-to-dirty edge"></canvas>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section id="services" class="rv" aria-labelledby="services-title">
<div class="container">
<header class="section-head">
<h2 id="services-title">Our Services</h2>
<p class="section-lead">Specialised exterior cleaning for every surface - from delicate render to heavy concrete.</p>
</header>
<div class="service-grid">
<article class="service-card rv">
<svg class="service-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2v20M17 5H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v10a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z"/><line x1="12" y1="9" x2="12" y2="15"/><line x1="9" y1="12" x2="15" y2="12"/></svg>
<h3>House & Building Wash</h3>
<p>Low-pressure soft wash for render, brick, weatherboard, and painted surfaces - removes mould, algae, and grime without damage.</p>
</article>
<article class="service-card rv">
<svg class="service-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 9l9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"/><polyline points="9 22 9 12 15 12 15 22"/></svg>
<h3>Roof Cleaning</h3>
<p>Non-abrasive treatment for tile, metal, and Colorbond roofs - kills organic growth at the source and prevents return.</p>
</article>
<article class="service-card rv">
<svg class="service-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="20" rx="2"/><path d="M8 12h8M12 8v8"/></svg>
<h3>Driveway & Path Pressure Clean</h3>
<p>High-pressure surface cleaning for concrete, pavers, exposed aggregate, and stone - restores original colour and slip resistance.</p>
</article>
<article class="service-card rv">
<svg class="service-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 12.79A9 9 0 1 1 11.21 3 7 7 0 0 0 21 12.79z"/><path d="M15 12a3 3 0 1 1-6 0 3 3 0 0 1 6 0z"/></svg>
<h3>Gutter Clearing</h3>
<p>Vacuum and manual clearing for residential and commercial gutters - prevents water damage and overflow.</p>
</article>
<article class="service-card rv">
<svg class="service-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"/><polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"/></svg>
<h3>Commercial & Strata</h3>
<p>Scheduled maintenance programs for apartments, offices, shopping centres, and industrial sites - compliant and reliable.</p>
</article>
<article class="service-card rv">
<svg class="service-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
<h3>Deck & Fence Restoration</h3>
<p>Gentle cleaning and prep for timber, composite, and coated surfaces - ready for oil, stain, or sealant.</p>
</article>
</div>
</div>
</section><section id="process" class="process-band rv" aria-labelledby="process-title">
<div class="container">
<header class="section-head">
<h2 id="process-title">Our Approach</h2>
<p class="section-lead">A consistent process - every job, every surface.</p>
</header>
<div class="process-steps">
<article class="step rv">
<div class="step-num">01</div>
<h3>Assess</h3>
<p>On-site inspection to identify surface type, contamination, and access.</p>
</article>
<article class="step rv">
<div class="step-num">02</div>
<h3>Prepare</h3>
<p>Protect plants, furnishings, and adjacent areas; set up containment where needed.</p>
</article>
<article class="step rv">
<div class="step-num">03</div>
<h3>Treat</h3>
<p>Apply the correct chemistry — soft wash for organics, pressure for hard surfaces.</p>
</article>
<article class="step rv">
<div class="step-num">04</div>
<h3>Rinse & Verify</h3>
<p>Thorough rinse, final walk-through, and before/after documentation.</p>
</article>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section id="locality" class="locality-band rv" aria-labelledby="locality-title">
<div class="container">
<div>
<h2 id="locality-title">Serving the Central Coast NSW</h2>
<p>From The Entrance to Pearl Beach, Gosford to Wyong - we know the salt, the mould, and the surfaces that handle them.</p>
</div>
<div class="locality-links">
