<section id="privacy" class="legal rv" aria-labelledby="privacy-title">
<div class="container">
<h2 id="privacy-title">Privacy Policy</h2>
<article>
<h3>Information We Collect</h3>
<p>We collect information you provide directly when you request a quote or contact us — name, email, phone, property address, and job details.</p>
</article>
<article>
<h3>How We Use Your Information</h3>
<p>To respond to enquiries, prepare quotes, schedule work, and communicate about your job. We do not sell personal data.</p>
</article>
<article>
<h3>Data Retention</h3>
<p>Enquiry data is retained while your job is active and for a reasonable period after for warranty and record-keeping.</p>
</article>
<article>
<h3>Your Rights</h3>
<p>You may request access, correction, or deletion of your personal information by contacting us.</p>
</article>
</div>
</section>
<section id="terms" class="legal rv" aria-labelledby="terms-title">
<div class="container">
<h2 id="terms-title">Terms of Service</h2>
<article>
<h3>Scope</h3>
<p>These terms apply to all exterior cleaning services provided by Central Coast Exterior Cleaning.</p>
</article>
<article>
<h3>Quotes & Pricing</h3>
<p>Quotes are based on the information provided and site conditions at the time of inspection. Final price may vary if conditions differ materially.</p>
</article>
<article>
<h3>Scheduling & Access</h3>
<p>We agree a date and time window. Safe access to the work area, water supply, and power (where required) must be available.</p>
</article>
<article>
<h3>Weather & Rescheduling</h3>
<p>Exterior cleaning is weather-dependent. We will contact you to reschedule if conditions are unsafe or compromise results.</p>
</article>
<article>
<h3>Liability</h3>
<p>We carry public liability insurance. Liability for pre-existing surface defects, coatings, or conditions is excluded.</p>
</article>
<article>
<h3>Governing Law</h3>
<p>These terms are governed by the laws of New South Wales, Australia.</p>
</article>
</div>
</section>
</main>
